\",31],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"base_controller.go\\\",708],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"base_controller.go\\\",1093]],\\\"⚠️ Rejecting an invalid report UUID as a bad request is consistent with explicit validation and shared HTTP mapping. The contract's response list omits that client-error outcome.\\\"],[\\\"U12\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"LaunchController.java\\\",484],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"LaunchController.java\\\",499],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"GetLaunchHandlerImpl.java\\\",340]],\\\"⚠️ The project-scoped export passes only launchId to a global lookup. The export handler never verifies the launch belongs to the selected project, violating route scoping.\\\"],[\\\"U13\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"ditto-api-2.yml\\\",467],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"ConnectionType.java\\\",53],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"ImmutableConnection.java\\\",388],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"RetrieveConnectionsResponse.java\\\",133]],\\\"⚠️ The collection serializes connection domain types directly, and that domain explicitly includes mqtt-5. The contract's enumeration is incomplete.\\\"],[\\\"U14\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",2,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"swagger.yaml\\\",13],[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"swagger.yaml\\\",577],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"router.go\\\",63],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"repository.go\\\",203]],\\\"⚠️ Both registered routing and handler documentation consistently use manifests. The contract's singular manifest path appears to be a documentation error, although no history confirms which spelling was originally intended.\\\"],[\\\"U15\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"openapi.yaml\\\",1397],[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"openapi.yaml\\\",6051],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"UserResource.java\\\",216],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"User.java\\\",479],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"TOSVersion.java\\\",22]],\\\"⚠️ The stored terms-of-service domain explicitly includes version 2 and the JSON getter returns that enum. The response schema has not included the supported additional value.\\\"],[\\\"U16\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"EnvironmentsResource.java\\\",59],[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"CategoryResource.java\\\",195],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"CategoryServiceImpl.java\\\",257]],\\\"⚠️ Deletion receives the environment context but globally resolves categoryId and deletes without matching the category's environment. The implementation fails to enforce the selected environment's scope.\\\"],[\\\"U17\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"tpp_banking_api_pis.yml\\\",183],[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"tpp_banking_api_commons.yml\\\",344],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"TppBankingApiPisController.java\\\",62],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"TppBankingApiPisController.java\\\",67],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"Address.java\\\",9]],\\\"⚠️ The request exposes townName while the domain address stores city. The mapper declares no translation between these differently named properties, losing the submitted town during payment initiation.\\\"],[\\\"U18\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",2,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"UserResource.java\\\",225],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"UserResource.java\\\",227],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"TokenDAO.java\\\",70]],\\\"⚠️ The targeted shape mismatch comes from the single-Token annotation despite a deliberate list return. The separate Quay DAO selection is also suspicious but does not justify documenting the response as one token.\\\"],[\\\"U19\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"ditto-api-2.yml\\\",599],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"ThingCommandEnforcement.java\\\",892]],\\\"⚠️ Merge-patch authorization deliberately checks unrestricted WRITE on every affected leaf when root permission is partial. The contract overstates the requirement by excluding this explicit, resource-scoped authorization path.\\\"],[\\\"U20\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"ditto-api-2.yml\\\",4668],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"Thing.java\\\",670],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"ImmutableThing.java\\\",544]],\\\"⚠️ Metadata has an explicit JSON-object field definition and object serialization. The response schema's string type is inconsistent with the structured metadata model.\\\"],[\\\"U21\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"policyEntry.yml\\\",20],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"PolicyEntriesRoute.java\\\",179],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"ImmutablePolicyEntry.java\\\",161]],\\\"⚠️ The domain can read and retain allowedImportAdditions, and the request schema permits it. The PUT-specific reconstruction drops that property instead of passing it into the supported domain model.\\\"],[\\\"U22\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"ditto-api-2.yml\\\",119],[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"ditto-api-2.yml\\\",580],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"ImmutableConnection.java\\\",204],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"ImmutableConnection.java\\\",389],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"RetrieveConnectionStrategy.java\\\",42]],\\\"⚠️ The connection model reads and writes scalar connectivity status names. The schema incorrectly references the separate aggregate connection-status object for this scalar field.\\\"],[\\\"U23\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"openapi.yaml\\\",1397],[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"openapi.yaml\\\",6296],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"UserResource.java\\\",201],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"User.java\\\",479],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"TOSVersion.java\\\",22]],\\\"⚠️ User retrieval returns the stored enum through its JSON getter, and that enum intentionally includes TOS_VERSION_2. The response schema omits a supported terms-of-service version.\\\"],[\\\"U24\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"OrganizationProjectController.java\\\",109],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"OrganizationProjectController.java\\\",124]],\\\"⚠️ The documented slug filter has its own supplied value, but the implementation builds slug equality from name. The wrong variable causes incorrect project filtering.\\\"],[\\\"U25\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",2,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"openapi-analytics.yaml\\\",987],[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"openapi-analytics.yaml\\\",1720],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"DashboardResource.java\\\",72],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"DashboardMapper.java\\\",54],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"DashboardWidget.java\\\",35],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"CustomDashboardWidget.java\\\",34]],\\\"⚠️ Update accepts widget descriptions through the documented schema, but neither mapped domain widgets nor persisted widgets can store them. The implementation drops an explicitly supported input field.\\\"],[\\\"U26\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",2,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"swagger.yaml\\\",958],[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"swagger.yaml\\\",2030],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"preheat.go\\\",57]],\\\"⚠️ The contract explicitly promises a created-instance ID object. The handler discards the creation result and constructs success without attaching a payload, leaving that documented output unpopulated.\\\"],[\\\"U27\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"swagger.yaml\\\",1002],[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"swagger.yaml\\\",1293],[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"swagger.yaml\\\",1350],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"preheat.go\\\",263],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"base.go\\\",193],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"errors.go\\\",92]],\\\"⚠️ The shared error serializer deliberately wraps errors in an object, and this handler uses that shared response path. The contract's bare-array definition misdescribes the common error envelope.\\\"],[\\\"U28\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"WidgetController.java\\\",89],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"WidgetController.java\\\",93],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"GetWidgetHandlerImpl.java\\\",145],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"GetWidgetHandlerImpl.java\\\",160]],\\\"⚠️ Omitted attributes are allowed at the controller boundary, but content loading passes the nullable array directly to Lists.newArrayList. The implementation fails to supply an empty default or handle the omitted input.\\\"],[\\\"U29\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"tpp_banking_api_pis.yml\\\",231],[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"tpp_banking_api_commons.yml\\\",344],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"TppBankingApiPisInfoController.java\\\",62],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"TppBankingApiPisInfoController.java\\\",92],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"Address.java\\\",9]],\\\"⚠️ Payment information maps an address with city into the response schema's townName. No mapping bridges the different property names, so the implementation omits documented address information.\\\"],[\\\"U30\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"ProjectController.java\\\",302],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"ProjectController.java\\\",305]],\\\"⚠️ The trailing-slash route binds projectName, while its handler requires projectKey. This runtime binding mismatch prevents the promised successful preference retrieval.\\\"],[\\\"U31\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"swagger.yaml\\\",800],[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"swagger.yaml\\\",1301],[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"swagger.yaml\\\",1350],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"preheat.go\\\",74],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"base.go\\\",193],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"errors.go\\\",92]],\\\"⚠️ Instance deletion sends failures through the shared serializer, which explicitly creates an errors object envelope. The contract's top-level array definition does not describe that established response representation.\\\"],[\\\"U32\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"ditto-api-2.yml\\\",25],[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"ditto-api-2.yml\\\",67],[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"featureIdPathPathParam.yml\\\",11],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"FeaturesRoute.java\\\",104]],\\\"⚠️ The operation patches the features collection and its path contains only thingId. Requiring featureId as another path parameter is internally inconsistent; the implementation correctly handles the collection body at path end.\\\"],[\\\"U33\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"TestItemController.java\\\",481],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"UpdateTestItemHandlerImpl.java\\\",370]],\\\"⚠️ Membership identifies the selected project, but bulk update checks only that project exists before globally loading item IDs. It changes item descriptions without confirming those items belong to the selected project.\\\"],[\\\"U34\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",2,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"UserController.java\\\",317],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"UserController.java\\\",320],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"ApiKeyHandlerImpl.java\\\",93]],\\\"⚠️ The nested route identifies a user's key, but deletion ignores userId and uses global key existence alone. The implementation does not enforce the parent-child association represented by its route.\\\"],[\\\"U35\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",2,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"swagger.yaml\\\",1009],[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"swagger.yaml\\\",2024],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"preheat.go\\\",74]],\\\"⚠️ The response schema explicitly declares an object identifying the removed instance. Although the handler has the instance ID, its success responder never receives that promised payload.\\\"],[\\\"U36\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,[[\\\"contract\\\",\\\"ditto-api-2.yml\\\",4668],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"Thing.java\\\",670],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"ImmutableThing.java\\\",544],[\\\"impl\\\",\\\"RetrieveThingsResponse.java\\\",174]],\\\"⚠️ Collection retrieval serializes selected Thing fields through the object-valued metadata definition. The contract incorrectly describes that structured field as a string.\\\"]]\"
import csv,json
from pathlib import Path
from collections import Counter
rows=json.loads(DATA)
items=list(csv.DictReader(Path('items.csv').open(newline='')))
assert [r[0] for r in rows]==[r['item_id'] for r in items]
assert len(rows)==36 and len({r[0] for r in rows})==36
resolved=[]
for item,label,confidence,evidence,rationale in rows:
 assert label in {'SPEC','IMPL','TEST','ENV','UNDECIDABLE'}
 assert confidence in {1,2,3}
 assert len(rationale.split())<=40
 locators=[]
 for side,pattern,line in evidence:
  root=Path(item)/side
  matches=[p for p in root.rglob(pattern) if p.is_file()]
  assert len(matches)==1,(item,pattern,matches)
  p=matches[0]
  assert 1<=line<=len(p.read_text().splitlines()),(p,line)
  locators.append(f'{p}:{line}')
 resolved.append({'item_id':item,'L1':label,'confidence':confidence,'evidence_locators':'; '.join(locators),'rationale':rationale})
for target in ['labels_L5.csv','report_L5.md']:
 assert not Path(target).exists(),f'Output already exists: {target}'
with Path('labels_L5.csv').open('x',newline='') as out:
 writer=csv.DictWriter(out,fieldnames=['item_id','L1','confidence','evidence_locators','rationale'])
 writer.writeheader();writer.writerows(resolved)
def cite(item,side,pattern,line):
 matches=list((Path(item)/side).rglob(pattern))
 assert len(matches)==1
 return f'[{item}: {matches[0].name}:{line}]({matches[0]}#L{line})'
counts=Counter(r['L1'] for r in resolved)
confs=Counter(r['confidence'] for r in resolved)
report=f\"\"\"L5 হিসেবে TASK_M1.md-এর নির্দেশ মেনে items.csv-এর ক্রমে U01–U36-এর প্রত্যেকটিতে একটি L1 label দেওয়া হয়েছে। প্রতিটি item-এর contract ও implementation আলাদাভাবে পড়া হয়েছে; ভিন্ন item-এর file তুলনা করা হয়নি। Proposition-কে যাচাইয়ের লক্ষ্য হিসেবে ধরে schema, annotation, route binding, mapper, domain model এবং handler-এর প্রাসঙ্গিক অংশ পরীক্ষা করা হয়েছে। প্রতিটি সিদ্ধান্তের file:line evidence labels_L5.csv-এর evidence_locators-এ আছে; উদ্দেশ্য সম্পর্কে inference rationale-এ ⚠️ দিয়ে চিহ্নিত। নির্দেশের উৎস: [TASK_M1.md](TASK_M1.md), item-ক্রমের উৎস: [items.csv](items.csv)।

Label distribution নিচে দেওয়া হলো। গণনার উৎস: [labels_L5.csv](labels_L5.csv), item_id U01–U36।

| L1 | সংখ্যা |
| --- | ---: |
| SPEC | {counts['SPEC']} |
| IMPL | {counts['IMPL']} |
| TEST | {counts['TEST']} |
| ENV | {counts['ENV']} |
| UNDECIDABLE | {counts['UNDECIDABLE']} |
| মোট | {len(resolved)} |

Confidence 3 দেওয়া হয়েছে {confs[3]}টি এবং confidence 2 দেওয়া হয়েছে {confs[2]}টি item-এ; confidence 1 দেওয়া হয়নি। উৎস: labels_L5.csv-এর confidence column, U01–U36। প্রতিটি rationale সর্বোচ্চ 40 শব্দের; পাঁচটি নির্ধারিত L1 value ছাড়া অন্য label বা L2 তৈরি করা হয়নি।

কঠিন ক্ষেত্রে mismatch এবং উদ্দেশ্যভিত্তিক attribution আলাদা করে বিচার করা হয়েছে। U02-তে widget description contract-এ আছে, কিন্তু domain ও persistence model-এ নেই। ⚠️ লিখিত input promise পূরণ না হওয়াকে IMPL ধরা হয়েছে; অতিরিক্ত schema property হওয়ার বিকল্প ব্যাখ্যা পুরোপুরি বাদ দেওয়া যায় না, তাই confidence 2। প্রমাণ: {cite('U02','contract','openapi-analytics.yaml',1720)}, {cite('U02','impl','DashboardWidget.java',35)}, {cite('U02','impl','CustomDashboardWidget.java',34)}। U25-এর update বিচারেও সেই item-এর নিজস্ব contract ও implementation ব্যবহার করা হয়েছে: {cite('U25','contract','openapi-analytics.yaml',1720)}, {cite('U25','impl','DashboardResource.java',72)}, {cite('U25','impl','DashboardWidget.java',35)}।

U14-তে singular/plural path-এর বিরোধে implementation router ও handler-এর নিজস্ব বিবরণ একমত। ⚠️ তাই contract-এর spelling-কে SPEC, confidence 2 দেওয়া হয়েছে; ইতিহাস ছাড়া মূল spelling-এর উদ্দেশ্য নিশ্চিত নয়। প্রমাণ: {cite('U14','contract','swagger.yaml',577)}, {cite('U14','impl','router.go',63)}, {cite('U14','impl','repository.go',203)}।

U18-এর বিচার proposition-এর response shape নিয়ে। ⚠️ List return ও DAO collection-এর বিপরীতে single-Token annotation-কে SPEC ধরা হয়েছে। আলাদাভাবে handler-এ Quay DAO নির্বাচনও সন্দেহজনক; সেই পৃথক আচরণকে এই shape mismatch-এর বিকল্প ব্যাখ্যা হিসেবে ব্যবহার করা হয়নি। প্রমাণ: {cite('U18','contract','UserResource.java',226)}, {cite('U18','impl','UserResource.java',227)}, {cite('U18','impl','TokenDAO.java',70)}।

U19-তে partial-root WRITE থাকলেও প্রতিটি পরিবর্তিত leaf-এর unrestricted WRITE পরীক্ষা করা হচ্ছে। ⚠️ এটি সচেতনভাবে লেখা সূক্ষ্ম permission path বলে contract-এর কেবল root permission প্রয়োজনের বক্তব্যকে SPEC ধরা হয়েছে। প্রমাণ: {cite('U19','contract','ditto-api-2.yml',599)}, {cite('U19','impl','ThingCommandEnforcement.java',892)}।

U26 ও U35-তে declared success object handler পূরণ করে না। ⚠️ প্রত্যেকটির নিজস্ব explicit response promise অনুসারে IMPL, confidence 2 দেওয়া হয়েছে। Generated responder source ও runtime exchange অনুপস্থিত থাকায় সুনির্দিষ্ট wire body কিংবা খালি success ইচ্ছাকৃত কি না নিশ্চিত করা যায়নি। প্রমাণ: {cite('U26','contract','swagger.yaml',958)}, {cite('U26','impl','preheat.go',57)}; {cite('U35','contract','swagger.yaml',1009)}, {cite('U35','impl','preheat.go',74)}।

U34-তে userId নেওয়া হলেও deletion-এ সেটি ব্যবহার হয় না; কেবল keyId দিয়ে existence ও delete করা হয়। ⚠️ route-এর parent-child association রক্ষা না করাকে IMPL ধরা হয়েছে। সম্পূর্ণ deployment security configuration না থাকায় সর্বজনীন exploitability দাবি করা হয়নি; confidence 2। প্রমাণ: {cite('U34','contract','UserController.java',317)}, {cite('U34','impl','ApiKeyHandlerImpl.java',93)}।

সীমাবদ্ধতা: এটি সরবরাহকৃত source-এর static review। Runtime exchange এবং VCS history নেই—TASK_M1.md-তেই এই সীমা নির্ধারিত। Framework binding ও generated mapping-এর ফল সংশ্লিষ্ট declaration এবং call path থেকে infer করা হয়েছে; চালিয়ে যাচাই করা হয়নি। Network, Docker, Java, Maven, compilation, repository module import বা item source execution করা হয়নি। শুধু standard-library Python দিয়ে package data পড়া, output লেখা ও output structure যাচাই করা হয়েছে। Codebook, intent tool বা external tool source ব্যবহার করা হয়নি।

